ar, Compliance Officer\/HUB International, Insurance Services,\u00a0who has over 20 years of experience in the insurance industry and insider information from Washington D.C..<\/p><p>This live webinar was\u00a0 held on Thursday, October 19, 2017 at 1pm EDT\/10am PDT.<\/p><p><!-- June 28, 2023, Adam Wright (Corp Marketing) commenting out because link is broken and it was a limited-time promotion<br \/><strong>P.S. Interested in a FREE VBMAPP license? Take advantage of our\u00a0<!-- Nov 7, 2022 Adam W relaced original go.rethinkfirst.com\/rethinkbh_vbmapp?utm_campaign=bhvb17&amp;utm_source=blog&amp;utm_medium=blog link because it did not have HTTPS and with it forwarded to rethinkfirst.com <a href=\"https:\/\/go.rethinkfirst.com\/rethink-vbmapp?utm_campaign=bhvb17&amp;utm_source=blog&amp;utm_medium=blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">limited-time promotion<\/a>\u00a0for new and existing clients!<\/strong> --><\/p><p>RethinkBH holds a monthly webinar series entitled Entrepreneurship in ABA.<\/p><p>This targeted set of presentations will focus on the business aspects of running an ABA provider group.<\/p><p>Whether you are just getting started, or in high growth mode, this series will offer insights and best practices for helping your business succeed.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":22758,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Affordable Care Act: How It Affects Your Business","_seopress_titles_desc":"Signed in 2010, the Affordable Care Act is entering the final stages of implementation. Find out what opportunities or risks the ACA could represent to you.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[69,74],"resource-tag":[],"class_list":["post